<title>ITALY: Italy's Standa suspended pending statement.</title>
<headline>Italy's Standa suspended pending statement.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Italian retail distribution group Standa were suspended on Thursday pending the release of a statement, market watchdog Consob said.</p>
